WEBVTT

00:08:29.046 --> 00:08:31.298
So if you have an idea or interest

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:34.969
for how to make a historically
inaccessible field more equitable,

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:36.595
grab a few friends,

00:08:36.637 --> 00:08:40.057
brainstorm a way that you can break down
the barriers in your field

00:08:40.099 --> 00:08:42.142
and start a virtual nonprofit.

00:08:42.142 --> 00:08:45.104
You may never meet the majority
of the people that you serve,

00:08:45.104 --> 00:08:46.814
but the effects of your hard work

00:08:46.814 --> 00:08:49.817
will touch them in ways
that they will never forget.

00:08:49.817 --> 00:08:51.110
Thank you.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.361
(Applause)